<title>UK: OKB sets 150 mln stg November 1998 bond.</title>
<headline>OKB sets 150 mln stg November 1998 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KONTROLLBANK</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  REPUBLIC OF AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     6.30	MATURITY    17.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMS US/UK/AT/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OFF EUROSHELF FOR ISSUES OF DEBT SECURITIES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
